      "cooked": "<p>I rather enjoy painting miniatures, and wanted to give the ship miniatures some color. &nbsp;I'm diverting from the ship/character cards, but I'm trying to keep a feel for each of the races, captains, and playstyles of the ships. &nbsp;</p><p>First up: The Vigilance!</p><p>I wanted to show how the Vigilance is the kind of ship that can fly through a massive firefight and make it out alive. &nbsp;She may get a few holes in the process, but she'll make it to port. Any enemy that thinks she is wounded prey is going to get a rough surprise!</p><p>She is blue because I like blue.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57\" title=\"Vigilance (undamaged).JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57_2_669x499.jpeg\" alt=\"Vigilance (undamaged).JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"7AThGFvl6COLzjtDIGPEqCrGT9J\" width=\"669\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57_2_669x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57_2_1003x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/353acce995b3d56d0b106674036e4cf82111af57_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Vigilance (undamaged).JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">1118×835 358 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8\" title=\"Vigilance (damaged).JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8_2_669x499.jpeg\" alt=\"Vigilance (damaged).JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"23lxdHEENJ3M83Cn1zulVDH6ErK\" width=\"669\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8_2_669x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8_2_1003x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/0e6536eeb18f204cd3f8b9ecb180f1ba6717cab8_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Vigilance (damaged).JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">1060×792 337 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
