      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Very nice.&nbsp; Vigilance, now with BattleDamage (tm). :)</p><p>I started my painting with the two dwarf ships, figuring they&#39;d be the easiest since they&#39;re basically monochromatic.&nbsp; However, I couldn&#39;t bring myself to just leave them a single color like that, so I&#39;m experimenting with ways to give them a little more zazz.&nbsp; The Bjarlspire is looking good (the blue glowing spot on top came out well), but I&#39;m having a devil of a time making the other one look interesting since it&#39;s basically just a gray polygon.&nbsp; Still working through options.</p><p>I&#39;ll post pix once they&#39;re ready.</p>",
