      "created_at": "2014-06-03T16:30:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Speaking of the Bjarlspire...</p><p>I wanted the dwarven ships to look distinctive, and very, very metallic. &nbsp;I use a lot of acryllics, and gave the drive torches on the top and bottom some substance by mixing in a heavy gel medium. &nbsp;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d\" title=\"Bjarlspire.JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d_2_373x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Bjarlspire.JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"lTRNGIT6BOS0LkShHxXvjhKSDHT\" width=\"373\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d_2_373x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d_2_559x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/997e5ef4f27b62b75b0573f729d5701c4d3d8b8d_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Bjarlspire.JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">642×859 90.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
